      "content": "i know it's an emotional state but it doesnt feel like that. it feels like the truth. like i've already been deleted from the world. i look in the mirror and it's like i'm looking at a shadow. how am i supposed to keep going when the world has clearly moved on without me? it's like there's nothing left to actually be part of.",
